{"title":"style3d","summary":"这是一款适配手机竖屏的伪3D疾速闪避测试游戏，点击或触摸切换赛道并躲开前方障碍。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,maximum-scale=1,user-scalable=no,viewport-fit=cover" />
<title>style3d</title>
<style>
html,body{margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;background:#050816;touch-action:none;font-family:Arial,"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;}
body{display:flex;align-items:stretch;justify-content:stretch;}
canvas{display:block;width:100vw;height:100vh;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<canvas id="game"></canvas>
<script>
(function(){
  const canvas=document.getElementById('game');
  const ctx=canvas.getContext('2d');
  let w=0,h=0,dpr=Math.max(1,Math.min(2,window.devicePixelRatio||1));

  function resize(){
    w=window.innerWidth;
    h=window.innerHeight;
    canvas.width=w*dpr;
    canvas.height=h*dpr;
    ctx.setTransform(dpr,0,0,dpr,0,0);
  }
  resize();
  window.addEventListener('resize',resize);

  const game={
    lane:1,
    targetLane:1,
    laneX:[-1,0,1],
    obstacles:[],
    stars:[],
    speed:0.012,
    distance:0,
    score:0,
    best:+localStorage.getItem('style3d_best')||0,
    running:false,
    gameOver:false,
    startTime:0,
    flash:0
  };

  for(let i=0;i<90;i++){
    game.stars.push({x:Math.random(),y:Math.random(),z:0.2+Math.random()*0.8,s:1+Math.random()*2});
  }

  function reset(){
    game.lane=1;
    game.targetLane=1;
    game.obstacles=[];
    game.speed=0.012;
    game.distance=0;
    game.score=0;
    game.running=true;
    game.gameOver=false;
    game.startTime=performance.now();
    game.flash=0;
    let z=0.9;
    for(let i=0;i<8;i++){
      spawnObstacle(z+i*0.18,true);
    }
  }

  function spawnObstacle(z,initial){
    const lane=Math.floor(Math.random()*3);
    const type=Math.random()<0.22?'wide':'block';
    game.obstacles.push({
      lane:lane,
      z:z,
      w:type==='wide'?1.35:0.7,
      h:type==='wide'?0.42:0.52,
      hue:200+Math.random()*120,
      passed:false,
      type:type
    });
    if(!initial){
      game.obstacles.sort((a,b)=>a.z-b.z);
    }
  }

  function input(){
    if(!game.running){
      reset();
      return;
    }
    game.targetLane=(game.targetLane+1)%3;
  }

  canvas.addEventListener('pointerdown',function(e){e.preventDefault();input();},{passive:false});

  function project(wx,z,y){
    const horizon=h*0.22;
    const roadBottom=h*0.92;
    const t=1-z;
    const scale=0.16+Math.pow(t,1.35)*1.75;
    const cx=w*0.5+wx*w*0.23*scale;
    const cy=horizon+(roadBottom-horizon)*Math.pow(z,1.08)-y*h*0.2*scale;
    return {x:cx,y:cy,s:scale};
  }

  function update(dt){
    if(!game.running)return;
    game.speed=Math.min(0.028,game.speed+dt*0.0000017);
    game.distance+=dt*game.speed*60;
    game.score=Math.floor(game.distance*10);
    game.lane += (game.targetLane-game.lane)*Math.min(1,dt*0.018);
    if(game.flash>0)game.flash=Math.max(0,game.flash-dt*0.004);

    for(const s of game.stars){
      s.y += dt*0.00003*(0.3+s.z);
      if(s.y>1.05){s.y=-0.05; s.x=Math.random(); s.z=0.2+Math.random()*0.8;}
    }

    let maxZ=0;
    for(let i=game.obstacles.length-1;i>=0;i--){
      const o=game.obstacles[i];
      o.z -= dt*game.speed;
      if(o.z>maxZ)maxZ=o.z;
      if(!o.passed && o.z<0.18){
        o.passed=true;
        const dx=Math.abs(o.lane-game.lane);
        const hit = o.type==='wide' ? dx<0.95 : dx<0.42;
        if(hit){
          game.running=false;
          game.gameOver=true;
          game.flash=1;
          if(game.score>game.best){game.best=game.score;localStorage.setItem('style3d_best',game.best);}
        }
      }
      if(o.z<-0.2){
        game.obstacles.splice(i,1);
      }
    }

    while(game.obstacles.length<9){
      maxZ=Math.max(maxZ,0.7);
      maxZ += 0.15 + Math.random()*0.12;
      spawnObstacle(maxZ,false);
    }
  }

  function drawBackground(){
    const g=ctx.createLinearGradient(0,0,0,h);
    g.addColorStop(0,'#07111f');
    g.addColorStop(0.45,'#0a1d36');
    g.addColorStop(1,'#03060f');
    ctx.fillStyle=g;
    ctx.fillRect(0,0,w,h);

    for(const s of game.stars){
      const x=s.x*w;
      const y=s.y*h*0.55;
      const a=0.25+0.55*s.z;
      ctx.fillStyle='rgba(180,220,255,'+a+')';
      ctx.fillRect(x,y,s.s,s.s);
    }

    const sunY=h*0.16;
    const sun=ctx.createRadialGradient(w*0.5,sunY,10,w*0.5,sunY,h*0.18);
    sun.addColorStop(0,'rgba(0,255,240,0.28)');
    sun.addColorStop(1,'rgba(0,255,240,0)');
    ctx.fillStyle=sun;
    ctx.beginPath();
    ctx.arc(w*0.5,sunY,h*0.18,0,Math.PI*2);
    ctx.fill();
  }

  function drawRoad(){
    const horizon=h*0.22;
    const bottom=h*0.94;
    const leftTop=w*0.36;
    const rightTop=w*0.64;
    const leftBottom=w*0.08;
    const rightBottom=w*0.92;

    const roadGrad=ctx.createLinearGradient(0,horizon,0,bottom);
    roadGrad.addColorStop(0,'#0b1530');
    roadGrad.addColorStop(1,'#121212');
    ctx.fillStyle=roadGrad;
    ctx.beginPath();
    ctx.moveTo(leftTop,horizon);
    ctx.lineTo(rightTop,horizon);
    ctx.lineTo(rightBottom,bottom);
    ctx.lineTo(leftBottom,bottom);
    ctx.closePath();
    ctx.fill();

    ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(0,255,230,0.18)';
    ctx.lineWidth=2;
    for(let i=0;i<24;i++){
      const z=i/24;
      const y=horizon+(bottom-horizon)*Math.pow(z,1.08);
      const half=(rightTop-leftTop)/2 + ((rightBottom-leftBottom)/2-(rightTop-leftTop)/2)*Math.pow(z,1.08);
      ctx.beginPath();
      ctx.moveTo(w*0.5-half,y);
      ctx.lineTo(w*0.5+half,y);
      ctx.stroke();
    }

    for(let lane=-0.5; lane<=0.5; lane+=1){
      ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(255,255,255,0.22)';
      ctx.lineWidth=3;
      ctx.beginPath();
      for(let i=0;i<18;i++){
        const z1=i/18;
        const z2=Math.min(1,(i+0.55)/18);
        const p1=project(lane,z1,0);
        const p2=project(lane,z2,0);
        if(i%2===0){ctx.moveTo(p1.x,p1.y);ctx.lineTo(p2.x,p2.y);}
      }
      ctx.stroke();
    }

    ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(0,255,220,0.5)';
    ctx.lineWidth=4;
    ctx.beginPath();
    ctx.moveTo(leftTop,horizon);
    ctx.lineTo(leftBottom,bottom);
    ctx.moveTo(rightTop,horizon);
    ctx.lineTo(rightBottom,bottom);
    ctx.stroke();
  }

  function drawObstacle(o){
    const base=project(game.laneX[o.lane],o.z,0);
    const size=Math.max(16,Math.min(w,h)*0.1*base.s*(o.type==='wide'?1.45:1));
    const height=size*(o.type==='wide'?0.8:1.15);
    const width=size*(o.type==='wide'?1.8:1.05);
    const topY=base.y-height;
    const sideShift=width*0.22;

    ctx.fillStyle='hsla('+o.hue+',90%,58%,0.95)';
    ctx.beginPath();
    ctx.moveTo(base.x-width/2,base.y);
    ctx.lineTo(base.x+width/2,base.y);
    ctx.lineTo(base.x+width/2,topY);
    ctx.lineTo(base.x-width/2,topY);
    ctx.closePath();
    ctx.fill();

    ctx.fillStyle='hsla('+o.hue+',95%,70%,0.95)';
    ctx.beginPath();
    ctx.moveTo(base.x-width/2,topY);
    ctx.lineTo(base.x-width/2+sideShift,topY-height*0.2);
    ctx.lineTo(base.x+width/2+sideShift,topY-height*0.2);
    ctx.lineTo(base.x+width/2,topY);
    ctx.closePath();
    ctx.fill();

    ctx.fillStyle='hsla('+o.hue+',85%,35%,0.95)';
    ctx.beginPath();
    ctx.moveTo(base.x+width/2,base.y);
    ctx.lineTo(base.x+width/2+sideShift,base.y-height*0.2);
    ctx.lineTo(base.x+width/2+sideShift,topY-height*0.2);
    ctx.lineTo(base.x+width/2,topY);
    ctx.closePath();
    ctx.fill();

    ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(255,255,255,0.18)';
    ctx.lineWidth=2;
    ctx.strokeRect(base.x-width/2,topY,width,height);
  }

  function drawPlayer(){
    const p=project(game.laneX[1]+(game.lane-1),0.09,0);
    const carW=Math.min(w,h)*0.12;
    const carH=carW*1.1;
    const x=p.x,y=p.y;

    ctx.save();
    ctx.translate(x,y);

    const glow=ctx.createRadialGradient(0,carH*0.1,4,0,carH*0.1,carW*1.2);
    glow.addColorStop(0,'rgba(0,255,240,0.35)');
    glow.addColorStop(1,'rgba(0,255,240,0)');
    ctx.fillStyle=glow;
    ctx.beginPath();
    ctx.ellipse(0,carH*0.15,carW*1.1,carH*0.7,0,0,Math.PI*2);
    ctx.fill();

    ctx.fillStyle='#0ff0ea';
    ctx.beginPath();
    ctx.moveTo(0,-carH*0.6);
    ctx.lineTo(carW*0.42,-carH*0.1);
    ctx.lineTo(carW*0.28,carH*0.5);
    ctx.lineTo(0,carH*0.7);
    ctx.lineTo(-carW*0.28,carH*0.5);
    ctx.lineTo(-carW*0.42,-carH*0.1);
    ctx.closePath();
    ctx.fill();

    ctx.fillStyle='#ffffff';
    ctx.beginPath();
    ctx.moveTo(0,-carH*0.4);
    ctx.lineTo(carW*0.18,0);
    ctx.lineTo(0,carH*0.25);
    ctx.lineTo(-carW*0.18,0);
    ctx.closePath();
    ctx.fill();

    ctx.fillStyle='rgba(255,120,80,0.9)';
    ctx.beginPath();
    ctx.ellipse(-carW*0.16,carH*0.55,carW*0.08,carH*0.18,0,0,Math.PI*2);
    ctx.ellipse(carW*0.16,carH*0.55,carW*0.08,carH*0.18,0,0,Math.PI*2);
    ctx.fill();

    ctx.restore();
  }

  function drawHud(){
    ctx.fillStyle='rgba(4,10,24,0.45)';
    ctx.fillRect(12,12,w-24,64);
    ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(0,255,220,0.28)';
    ctx.strokeRect(12,12,w-24,64);

    ctx.fillStyle='#dffcff';
    ctx.font='bold 22px Arial';
    ctx.textAlign='left';
    ctx.fillText('SCORE '+game.score,22,38);
    ctx.font='16px Arial';
    ctx.fillStyle='rgba(220,245,255,0.85)';
    ctx.fillText('BEST '+game.best,22,60);
    ctx.textAlign='right';
    ctx.fillText('点击/触摸切换赛道',w-22,49);
  }

  function drawOverlay(){
    if(game.running)return;
    ctx.fillStyle='rgba(2,6,16,0.5)';
    ctx.fillRect(0,0,w,h);
    ctx.textAlign='center';
    ctx.fillStyle='#ffffff';
    ctx.font='bold 38px Arial';
    ctx.fillText('style3d',w/2,h*0.24);
    ctx.font='18px Arial';
    ctx.fillStyle='rgba(220,245,255,0.92)';
    if(game.gameOver){
      ctx.fillText('碰撞结束  得分 '+game.score,w/2,h*0.34);
      ctx.fillText('点击屏幕重新开始',w/2,h*0.39);
    }else{
      ctx.fillText('伪3D 闪避测试',w/2,h*0.34);
      ctx.fillText('点击屏幕开始',w/2,h*0.39);
    }

    const cx=w/2, cy=h*0.63;
    const rw=Math.min(w*0.72,340), rh=110;
    ctx.fillStyle='rgba(0,0,0,0.24)';
    ctx.fillRect(cx-rw/2,cy-rh/2,rw,rh);
    ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(0,255,220,0.32)';
    ctx.strokeRect(cx-rw/2,cy-rh/2,rw,rh);
    ctx.textAlign='center';
    ctx.fillStyle='#bafcff';
    ctx.font='17px Arial';
    ctx.fillText('规则',cx,cy-18);
    ctx.fillStyle='rgba(230,245,255,0.92)';
    ctx.fillText('每次点击向右切换一条赛道',cx,cy+14);
    ctx.fillText('躲开障碍并尽量坚持更久',cx,cy+40);
  }

  function drawFlash(){
    if(game.flash<=0)return;
    ctx.fillStyle='rgba(255,80,80,'+(game.flash*0.35)+')';
    ctx.fillRect(0,0,w,h);
  }

  let last=performance.now();
  function loop(now){
    const dt=Math.min(33,now-last);
    last=now;
    update(dt);
    drawBackground();
    drawRoad();
    game.obstacles.sort((a,b)=>b.z-a.z);
    for(const o of game.obstacles){
      if(o.z<1.2 && o.z>-0.1) drawObstacle(o);
    }
    drawPlayer();
    drawHud();
    drawOverlay();
    drawFlash();
    requestAnimationFrame(loop);
  }
  requestAnimationFrame(loop);
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>"}

